### 核心数据模型

```
tenants (租户表)
├── id, name, plan, status, created_at
│
├── tenant_members (成员表)
│   ├── tenant_id, user_id, role
│   └── roles: owner / admin / member / viewer
│
├── tenant_configs (配置表)
│   ├── tenant_id, key, value
│   └── 每租户独立配置（功能开关、限额等）
│
└── tenant_usage (用量表)
    ├── tenant_id, metric, value, period
    └── 计费用量追踪
```

